{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03244","headline":"绿竹引 · 宋之问","name":"绿竹引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青溪绿潭潭水侧，修竹婵娟同一色。\n徒生僊实凤不游，老死空山人讵识。\n妙年秉愿逃俗纷，归卧嵩丘弄白云。\n含情傲睨慰心目，何可一日无此君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}